(Acme Corporation - Employee Handbook) Tj T*
(Version 3.2, effective 1 January 2026. Owner: People Operations.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. About this handbook) Tj T*
(This handbook applies to all full-time and part-time employees of Acme Corporation in) Tj T*
(India. Contractors and interns are covered by their own agreements unless a section says) Tj T*
(otherwise. If this handbook conflicts with your employment contract, your contract takes) Tj T*
(precedence.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Working hours) Tj T*
(Standard working hours are 9:30 AM to 6:30 PM, Monday to Friday, with a one-hour lunch) Tj T*
(break. Core collaboration hours, when everyone is expected to be reachable, are 11:00 AM) Tj T*
(to 4:00 PM. Flexible start times between 8:00 AM and 11:00 AM are allowed with your) Tj T*
(manager's agreement.) Tj T*
ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 280 30 Td (Page 1 of 4) Tj ET
