(4. Remote and hybrid work) Tj T*
(Employees may work from home up to 2 days per week with their manager's approval. Remote) Tj T*
(days should be agreed at least one day in advance and recorded in the team calendar. Fully) Tj T*
(remote arrangements require approval from both the employee's manager and the Head of) Tj T*
(People Operations, and are reviewed every 6 months. Employees working remotely must use) Tj T*
(the company VPN and must not work from public Wi-Fi without it.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Acme provides a one-time home office allowance of 15,000 INR for employees approved for 2) Tj T*
(or more remote days per week.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. Probation and notice period) Tj T*
(New employees serve a probation period of 3 months. During probation, either party may end) Tj T*
(employment with 2 weeks' notice. After probation, the notice period is 60 days for all) Tj T*
(employees, and 90 days for employees at Manager level and above. Notice may be shortened) Tj T*
(only with written approval from the Head of People Operations.) Tj T*
ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 280 30 Td (Page 3 of 4) Tj ET
endstream
