(6. Performance reviews) Tj T*
(Performance reviews happen twice a year, in April and October. Salary revisions take) Tj T*
(effect from 1 April and are based on the April review. Promotions can be proposed in) Tj T*
(either cycle.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(7. Benefits) Tj T*
(All employees and their dependants \(spouse and up to 2 children\) are covered by group) Tj T*
(health insurance with a sum insured of 5,00,000 INR per year. Employees may add parents to) Tj T*
(the policy at their own cost. Acme contributes 12% of basic salary to the Provident Fund.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(8. Raising concerns) Tj T*
(Questions about this handbook go to People Operations at people@acme.example. Concerns) Tj T*
(about misconduct should be raised under the Code of Conduct, which describes the) Tj T*
(confidential reporting channel.) Tj T*
ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 280 30 Td (Page 4 of 4) Tj ET
